sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Admin
  participant W as Inventory / Curator page
  participant D as adminDocumentReader.js
  participant M as importFormat.js<br/>(plain, no AI)
  participant V as api/assist-ingredient.js<br/>(Vercel)
  participant G as Gemini, then Groq, Mistral
  participant F as Firestore
  A->>W: drop PDF / Excel / Word file
  W->>D: extract text in the browser
  D-->>W: text
  W->>M: parse GlowUp import format
  alt text is in the format
    M-->>W: draft records
  else any other document
    W->>V: text + Firebase ID token
    V->>V: accounts:lookup + own admins doc
    V->>G: extract records (fixed provider order)
    G-->>V: JSON
    V-->>W: draft records + notes
  end
  W->>W: make-up check, duplicates, flag skin care
  W->>F: new brands/products Pending, reviewed false
  W->>F: productIngredientSuggestions for products without a list
  W-->>A: summary + flagged records
